MODULE: OperationReturnsReservationNeverReleased
TARGET: OperationReturns
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: completion persists but the idle reminder never releases its reservation
PERTURBS: ReleaseReservation

--- FIND
    /\ operation' = "none" /\ phase' = "idle"
--- REPLACE
    /\ operation' = operation /\ phase' = "idle"
--- END
